                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwami Davida wakaakukala kubusyu bwa-Jehova, wati, Mebo ndimeni, O Leza Jehova? Abalo basiluzuboma mbobani? Wandisisya buti kumakani aali boobu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi eci kacili cintu ciniini buyo mumeso aako, O Leza, nkaambo waamba makani aaluzubo lwangu ndemulanda wako aaciindi cilamfu ciciza. Wanditondezya mazyalani aaciza, O Leza Jehova, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
