                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Jehova, taakwe umbi uuli mbuli nduwe, Taakwe Leza umbi cita nduwe, mbubonya mbutumvwide mumatwi esu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa kuli musyobo nuuba umwi waansi ano uuli mbuli bantu bako baIsrayeli? Leza wakaya kuyoobanununa kuti babe bantu bakwe, Walicitila impuo impati iigambya mukutanda misyobo imwi kubusyu bwabantu bako ba-Israyeli mbowakanununa kuzwa ku-Egepita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bako ba-Israyeli wakababika kuti babe musyobo wako lyoonse akutamani. Ayebo, O Jehova, wakaba Leza wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino, O Jehova, majwi ngoamba aamulanda wako aluzubo lwakwe azuzikizigwe ncobeni akutamani. Kocita mbubonya mboamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
