        {
          "text": "Lino cikubotele kulongezya luzubo lwangu ndemulanda wako, kuti lukalilile kubusyu bwako lyoonse. Nkaambo kufumbwa ncolongezya webo, O Jehova, ciyoolongezegwa lyoonse.",
